    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a short and charming puzzle-platformer adventure as Kimchi, the kitten\u00a0on his journey through the history museum. Travel through stylized dioramas representing ancient Egypt and feudal Japan, all from a feline point of view. Discover fun facts and light challenges designed for a relaxed and family-friendly experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835170/extras/f2dc0cc8b7cbc37ccf0cf64437689b46.poster.avif?t=1754553657\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835170/extras/f2dc0cc8b7cbc37ccf0cf64437689b46.webp?t=1754553657\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=290 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835170/extras/4a7739795e10c072b73553b2c3fc3242.avif?t=1754553657\" width=600 height=27 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore beautiful dioramas painted with watercolors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the magic of the  animated movie classics. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A heartwarming perspective on cats through the ages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light platforming and puzzle-solving with intuitive controls </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be a cat..</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
